{
  "id": "RAW_a26c658c1c",
  "title": "码住！Claude Code 之父 Boris Cherny 亲传使用秘籍",
  "url": "https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5NjgzMzkwMQ==&mid=2653651534&idx=1&sn=4c5edf3fce906e63b12e9ed402cf7288",
  "date": "2026-07-29 22:24:00",
  "author": "傅盛",
  "siteName": "傅盛",
  "content": "<html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <p><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\">有朋友后台问我，你的CC我的CC好像不一样，怎么我安装了感觉没那么好用呢，是不是哪里没使对劲？</span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\">正好最近刷到Claude Code之父</span></span><b><span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: normal;\">Boris Cherny</span></span></b><span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\">做的实操分享，聊聊他每天都在用的小技巧。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"height: auto !important;\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260729201533_f888ff7.jpeg\"></span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-variant-caps:normal;white-space:normal;font-weight:400;font-size:16px;min-height:1em;box-sizing:border-box !important;text-decoration-thickness:initial;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;-webkit-tap-highlight-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);outline:0px;word-spacing:0px;text-indent:0px;font-family:-apple-system, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;orphans:2;text-decoration-color:initial;text-align:center;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;padding:0px;margin:12px 0px;visibility:visible;letter-spacing:normal;clear:both;text-decoration-style:initial;font-style:normal;text-transform:none;max-width:100%;font-variant-ligatures:normal;widows:2;\"><span style=\"font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:700;font-size:15px;box-sizing:border-box !important;float:none;text-decoration-thickness:initial;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;-webkit-tap-highlight-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);outline:0px;word-spacing:0px;text-indent:0px;font-family:&quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;orphans:2;text-decoration-color:initial;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;padding:0px;margin:0px;visibility:visible;letter-spacing:1px;display:inline !important;text-decoration-style:initial;font-style:normal;text-transform:none;max-width:100%;font-variant-ligatures:normal;widows:2;\"><span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;\">· · ·</span></span></p>\n  <h2 style=\"font-variant-caps:normal;white-space:normal;font-weight:400;font-size:20px;box-sizing:border-box !important;text-decoration-thickness:initial;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;-webkit-tap-highlight-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);outline:0px;word-spacing:0px;text-indent:0px;border-left:4px solid rgb(231, 76, 60);font-family:-apple-system, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;orphans:2;text-decoration-color:initial;text-align:left;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;padding:0px 0px 0px 12px;margin:36px 0px 8px;visibility:visible;letter-spacing:normal;text-decoration-style:initial;font-style:normal;text-transform:none;max-width:100%;font-variant-ligatures:normal;widows:2;\"><span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;font-weight: bold;\">开箱先做几件小事</span></span></h2>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\">第一，</span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">跑一下&nbsp;</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">/terminal-setup</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\">这个命令主要解决一个很小但很影响体验的问题：</span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">换行</span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\">。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\">配置完以后，你可以用Shift + Enter换行，不用每次为了多行输入搞得很别扭。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\">第二，</span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">跑&nbsp;</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">/theme</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\">把主题调成你舒服的模式。暗色、亮色、色盲友好主题都可以。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom: 8px;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" type=\"block\" style=\"height: auto !important;\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260729201534_c7f5d07.png\"></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\">第三，</span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">如果你在GitHub上工作，可以输入/install-github-app装GitHub App。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\">这样你就能在Issue或PR里直接@Claude，让它参与代码审查、问题分析、自动处理一些任务。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\">第四，</span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">自定义允许使用的工具集合。</span></span></p>\n  <p><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\">对于经常要确认、但风险很低的操作，提前设置成允许。这样Claude不用每一步都等你点头。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-variant-caps:normal;white-space:normal;font-weight:400;font-size:16px;min-height:1em;box-sizing:border-box !important;text-decoration-thickness:initial;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;-webkit-tap-highlight-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);outline:0px;word-spacing:0px;text-indent:0px;font-family:-apple-system, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;orphans:2;text-decoration-color:initial;text-align:center;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;padding:0px;margin:12px 0px;visibility:visible;letter-spacing:normal;clear:both;text-decoration-style:initial;font-style:normal;text-transform:none;max-width:100%;font-variant-ligatures:normal;widows:2;\"><span style=\"font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:700;font-size:15px;box-sizing:border-box !important;float:none;text-decoration-thickness:initial;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;-webkit-tap-highlight-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);outline:0px;word-spacing:0px;text-indent:0px;font-family:&quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;orphans:2;text-decoration-color:initial;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;padding:0px;margin:0px;visibility:visible;letter-spacing:1px;display:inline !important;text-decoration-style:initial;font-style:normal;text-transform:none;max-width:100%;font-variant-ligatures:normal;widows:2;\"><span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;\">· · ·</span></span></p>\n  <h2 style=\"font-variant-caps:normal;white-space:normal;font-weight:400;font-size:20px;box-sizing:border-box !important;text-decoration-thickness:initial;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;-webkit-tap-highlight-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);outline:0px;word-spacing:0px;text-indent:0px;border-left:4px solid rgb(231, 76, 60);font-family:-apple-system, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;orphans:2;text-decoration-color:initial;text-align:left;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;padding:0px 0px 0px 12px;margin:36px 0px 8px;visibility:visible;letter-spacing:normal;text-decoration-style:initial;font-style:normal;text-transform:none;max-width:100%;font-variant-ligatures:normal;widows:2;\"><span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;font-weight: bold;\">让AI认识你的项目</span></span></h2>\n  <p style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:8px;\"><span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\">大多数人拿到AI工具，第一反应是直接派活。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:8px;\"><span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\">Boris说这个顺序搞反了。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:8px;\"><span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\">你都不太清楚自己项目的全貌，AI更不清楚。在这种情况下让它写代码</span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">，撞对了是运气，翻车才是常态。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:8px;\"><span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\">他的做法是，</span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">先花时间让AI把整个代码库读一遍，然后问它问题</span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\">。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom: 8px;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" type=\"block\" style=\"height: auto !important;\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260729201534_d38acbe.png\"></p>\n  <p style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:8px;\"><span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\">比如：</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:8px;\"><span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\">\"帮我把这个项目的整体结构梳理一下，主要模块是什么，它们之间怎么配合？\"</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:8px;\"><span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\">\"如果我想给用户列表加一个排序功能，从哪里入手最合适？\"</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\">Claude Code会深入分析你的项目，给你一个像Wiki一样的解答。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom: 8px;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" type=\"block\" style=\"height: auto !important;\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260729201533_06f8cc8.png\"></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\">效果很直接，</span></span><b><span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\">Boris说Anthropic以前新人入职熟悉代码库要2到3周</span></span></b><span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\">，到处问人、自己翻文档。现在Claude Code带着探索一遍，</span></span><b><span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\">2到3天就能上手干活</span></span></b><span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\">。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-variant-caps:normal;white-space:normal;font-weight:400;font-size:16px;min-height:1em;box-sizing:border-box !important;text-decoration-thickness:initial;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;-webkit-tap-highlight-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);outline:0px;word-spacing:0px;text-indent:0px;font-family:-apple-system, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;orphans:2;text-decoration-color:initial;text-align:center;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;padding:0px;margin:12px 0px;visibility:visible;letter-spacing:normal;clear:both;text-decoration-style:initial;font-style:normal;text-transform:none;max-width:100%;font-variant-ligatures:normal;widows:2;\"><span style=\"font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:700;font-size:15px;box-sizing:border-box !important;float:none;text-decoration-thickness:initial;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;-webkit-tap-highlight-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);outline:0px;word-spacing:0px;text-indent:0px;font-family:&quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;orphans:2;text-decoration-color:initial;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;padding:0px;margin:0px;visibility:visible;letter-spacing:1px;display:inline !important;text-decoration-style:initial;font-style:normal;text-transform:none;max-width:100%;font-variant-ligatures:normal;widows:2;\"><span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;\">· · ·</span></span></p>\n  <h2 style=\"font-variant-caps:normal;white-space:normal;font-weight:400;font-size:20px;box-sizing:border-box !important;text-decoration-thickness:initial;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;-webkit-tap-highlight-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);outline:0px;word-spacing:0px;text-indent:0px;border-left:4px solid rgb(231, 76, 60);font-family:-apple-system, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;orphans:2;text-decoration-color:initial;text-align:left;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;padding:0px 0px 0px 12px;margin:36px 0px 8px;visibility:visible;letter-spacing:normal;text-decoration-style:initial;font-style:normal;text-transform:none;max-width:100%;font-variant-ligatures:normal;widows:2;\"><span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;font-weight: bold;\">先规划再动手</span></span></h2>\n  <p style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:8px;\"><span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\">凡事预则立不预则废。用AI也是一样。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:8px;\"><span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\">很多人用AI Coding就是把所有需求一股脑扔给它，然后等结果。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:8px;\"><span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\">这不许愿呢吗？</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:8px;\"><span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\">他的调整是：</span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: normal;\">在你说\"帮我做XX\"之后，</span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">加一句\"先给我一个实现方案，不要直接写代码\"。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom: 8px;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" type=\"block\" style=\"height: auto !important;\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260729201533_f89f614.png\"></p>\n  <p style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:8px;\"><span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">让AI先把它打算怎么做、分几步、涉及哪些部分说清楚</span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\">，你确认方向没问题，再让它动手。这样即使中间出了岔子，你也知道问题出在哪个环节。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-variant-caps:normal;white-space:normal;font-weight:400;font-size:16px;min-height:1em;box-sizing:border-box !important;text-decoration-thickness:initial;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;-webkit-tap-highlight-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);outline:0px;word-spacing:0px;text-indent:0px;font-family:-apple-system, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;orphans:2;text-decoration-color:initial;text-align:center;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;padding:0px;margin:12px 0px;visibility:visible;letter-spacing:normal;clear:both;text-decoration-style:initial;font-style:normal;text-transform:none;max-width:100%;font-variant-ligatures:normal;widows:2;\"><span style=\"font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:700;font-size:15px;box-sizing:border-box !important;float:none;text-decoration-thickness:initial;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;-webkit-tap-highlight-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);outline:0px;word-spacing:0px;text-indent:0px;font-family:&quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;orphans:2;text-decoration-color:initial;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;padding:0px;margin:0px;visibility:visible;letter-spacing:1px;display:inline !important;text-decoration-style:initial;font-style:normal;text-transform:none;max-width:100%;font-variant-ligatures:normal;widows:2;\"><span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;\">· · ·</span></span></p>\n  <h2 style=\"font-variant-caps:normal;white-space:normal;font-weight:400;font-size:20px;box-sizing:border-box !important;text-decoration-thickness:initial;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;-webkit-tap-highlight-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);outline:0px;word-spacing:0px;text-indent:0px;border-left:4px solid rgb(231, 76, 60);font-family:-apple-system, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;orphans:2;text-decoration-color:initial;text-align:left;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;padding:0px 0px 0px 12px;margin:36px 0px 8px;visibility:visible;letter-spacing:normal;text-decoration-style:initial;font-style:normal;text-transform:none;max-width:100%;font-variant-ligatures:normal;widows:2;\"><span><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">有了工具才有反馈闭环</span></span></h2>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\">Boris 说，Claude Code真正开始发光，是接入工具以后。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom: 8px;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" type=\"block\" style=\"height: auto !important;\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260729201534_875174e.png\"></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\">Claude Code接入团队工具，主要有两种方式：</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">一是通过Bash调用现有的CLI和脚本</span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\">，比如查日志、跑测试、发版、生成报告的内部CLI。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\">如果AI临时不会用，</span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">可以让它先运行&nbsp;</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">--help</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">&nbsp;看说明</span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\">，再根据说明选择参数。</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\">如果这个工具以后经常会用，可以把这段说明写进</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\">CLAUDE.md</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\">。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">二是通过MCP接入结构化工具和外部系统</span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\">，比如可以接数据库、浏览器、设计稿、内部平台。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\">新工程师入职，没有代码权限、没有日志权限、没有测试环境，再聪明也干不了活，Claude Code同理。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom: 8px;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" type=\"block\" style=\"height: auto !important;\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260729201533_8eb7616.png\"></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\">工具接好之后，它才能自我验证，才有反馈闭环。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\">Boris举了个例子，只说\"帮我做个页面\"，它可能做到七八十分。但给它设计稿，让它用</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\">Puppeteer工具截图对比，自己改两三轮，结果往往接近九十分。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">我在用Fable 5复刻红警的时候也是这样，AI写完代码会自动截图</span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\">，看看截图再去调整，完全不用我手动测试。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span><img alt=\"图片\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"height: auto !important;\" src=\"https://imagedelivery.net/qGOFcc1O8XwTZW3W1JAHHg/5ebc9d12-ca53-4357-b20c-c6da430bc500/public\"></span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-variant-caps:normal;white-space:normal;font-weight:400;font-size:16px;min-height:1em;box-sizing:border-box !important;text-decoration-thickness:initial;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;-webkit-tap-highlight-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);outline:0px;word-spacing:0px;text-indent:0px;font-family:-apple-system, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;orphans:2;text-decoration-color:initial;text-align:center;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;padding:0px;margin:12px 0px;visibility:visible;letter-spacing:normal;clear:both;text-decoration-style:initial;font-style:normal;text-transform:none;max-width:100%;font-variant-ligatures:normal;widows:2;\"><span style=\"font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:700;font-size:15px;box-sizing:border-box !important;float:none;text-decoration-thickness:initial;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;-webkit-tap-highlight-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);outline:0px;word-spacing:0px;text-indent:0px;font-family:&quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;orphans:2;text-decoration-color:initial;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;padding:0px;margin:0px;visibility:visible;letter-spacing:1px;display:inline !important;text-decoration-style:initial;font-style:normal;text-transform:none;max-width:100%;font-variant-ligatures:normal;widows:2;\"><span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;\">· · ·</span></span></p>\n  <h2 style=\"font-variant-caps:normal;white-space:normal;font-weight:400;font-size:20px;box-sizing:border-box !important;text-decoration-thickness:initial;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;-webkit-tap-highlight-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);outline:0px;word-spacing:0px;text-indent:0px;border-left:4px solid rgb(231, 76, 60);font-family:-apple-system, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;orphans:2;text-decoration-color:initial;text-align:left;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;padding:0px 0px 0px 12px;margin:36px 0px 8px;visibility:visible;letter-spacing:normal;text-decoration-style:initial;font-style:normal;text-transform:none;max-width:100%;font-variant-ligatures:normal;widows:2;\"><span><span style=\"font-size: 20px;font-weight: bold;\">CLAUDE.md：AI的入职手册</span></span></h2>\n  <p style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:8px;\"><span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\">Boris建议大家给Claude Code写一份入职手册，叫CLAUDE.md，专门用来告诉 AI 关于你和这个项目的所有关键信息。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:8px;\"><span><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" type=\"block\" style=\"height: auto !important;\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260729201533_8e600ad.png\"></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\">当然，</span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">上下文不是越长越好</span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\">，你写得太长，它每次都要读一大堆，</span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">不仅耗token，还容易把重点冲淡</span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\">。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\">所以我建议把CLAUDE.md写成</span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">“短、准、硬”的规则和索引</span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\">，重点写Claude Code干活时</span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">最容易踩坑、最必须知道的东西</span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\">：用什么命令启动，改完跑什么测试，哪些文件不能乱动，哪些规则不能破。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" type=\"block\" style=\"height: auto !important;\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260729201533_a57006b.png\"></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\">另外，</span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">CLAUDE.md不一定要放在根目录，也可以放在子目录里</span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\">。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\">大型项目里，完全可以在不同子目录各放一份。前端目录写前端规矩，后端目录写后端规矩，移动端目录写移动端规矩。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" type=\"block\" style=\"height: auto !important;\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260729201534_08a311a.png\"></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\">这就像公司培训新人，不可能第一天把财务、人事、销售、研发所有制度全塞给他。最好的方式是：他在哪个岗位，就看哪个岗位最相关的手册。Claude Code也是一样，</span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">需要什么上下文，就给它什么上下文。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-variant-caps:normal;white-space:normal;font-weight:400;font-size:16px;min-height:1em;box-sizing:border-box !important;text-decoration-thickness:initial;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;-webkit-tap-highlight-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);outline:0px;word-spacing:0px;text-indent:0px;font-family:-apple-system, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;orphans:2;text-decoration-color:initial;text-align:center;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;padding:0px;margin:12px 0px;visibility:visible;letter-spacing:normal;clear:both;text-decoration-style:initial;font-style:normal;text-transform:none;max-width:100%;font-variant-ligatures:normal;widows:2;\"><span style=\"font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:700;font-size:15px;box-sizing:border-box !important;float:none;text-decoration-thickness:initial;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;-webkit-tap-highlight-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);outline:0px;word-spacing:0px;text-indent:0px;font-family:&quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;orphans:2;text-decoration-color:initial;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;padding:0px;margin:0px;visibility:visible;letter-spacing:1px;display:inline !important;text-decoration-style:initial;font-style:normal;text-transform:none;max-width:100%;font-variant-ligatures:normal;widows:2;\"><span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;\">· · ·</span></span></p>\n  <h2 style=\"font-variant-caps:normal;white-space:normal;font-weight:400;font-size:20px;box-sizing:border-box !important;text-decoration-thickness:initial;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;-webkit-tap-highlight-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);outline:0px;word-spacing:0px;text-indent:0px;border-left:4px solid rgb(231, 76, 60);font-family:-apple-system, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;orphans:2;text-decoration-color:initial;text-align:left;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;padding:0px 0px 0px 12px;margin:36px 0px 8px;visibility:visible;letter-spacing:normal;text-decoration-style:initial;font-style:normal;text-transform:none;max-width:100%;font-variant-ligatures:normal;widows:2;\"><span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;font-weight: bold;\">明显改变手感的快捷键</span></span></h2>\n  <p style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:8px;\"><span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\">最后，Boris还分享了几个每天都能用上的快捷键。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom: 8px;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" type=\"block\" style=\"height: auto !important;\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260729201533_796676f.png\"></p>\n  <ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\" class=\"list-paddingleft-1\">\n   <li>\n    <p style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:8px;\"><span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\">按</span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">Shift+Tab</span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\">，开启自动接受编辑模式。AI写的代码修改会自动应用，不用一条一条反复确认。等它跑完你再统一检查，效率高很多。</span></span></p>\n   </li>\n   <li>\n    <p style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:8px;\"><span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">按 # 让AI记住规则。</span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\">如果AI哪个地方说错了或者理解偏了，可以敲一个</span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">\"#\"</span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\">，它自动把这条记录写进CLAUDE.md，下次就不会再犯同样的错。</span></span></p>\n   </li>\n   <li>\n    <p style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:8px;\"><span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">按Esc随时打断。</span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\">如果你觉得 AI 方向跑偏了，或者突然想到新要求，直接按 Esc 就能打断它。不会丢数据，不会损坏文件，暂停完补充新指令它就接着走。</span></span></p>\n   </li>\n   <li>\n    <p style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:8px;\"><span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">Ctrl+R看原始对话。</span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\">有时候用AI会疑惑\"它到底看到了什么才会这么回\"。这个快捷键能展开完整的对话记录，AI眼里看到的输入输出都在里面，排查问题特别好用。</span></span></p>\n   </li>\n   <li>\n    <p style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:8px;\"><span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">claude --resume</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">恢复上次没聊完的。</span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\">在命令行里输入 claude --resume，就能回到上一次中断的对话，接着往下聊。</span></span></p>\n   </li>\n  </ul>\n  <p style=\"font-variant-caps:normal;white-space:normal;font-weight:400;font-size:16px;min-height:1em;box-sizing:border-box !important;text-decoration-thickness:initial;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;-webkit-tap-highlight-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);outline:0px;word-spacing:0px;text-indent:0px;font-family:-apple-system, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;orphans:2;text-decoration-color:initial;text-align:center;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;padding:0px;margin:12px 0px;visibility:visible;letter-spacing:normal;clear:both;text-decoration-style:initial;font-style:normal;text-transform:none;max-width:100%;font-variant-ligatures:normal;widows:2;\"><span style=\"font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:700;font-size:15px;box-sizing:border-box !important;float:none;text-decoration-thickness:initial;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;-webkit-tap-highlight-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);outline:0px;word-spacing:0px;text-indent:0px;font-family:&quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;orphans:2;text-decoration-color:initial;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;padding:0px;margin:0px;visibility:visible;letter-spacing:1px;display:inline !important;text-decoration-style:initial;font-style:normal;text-transform:none;max-width:100%;font-variant-ligatures:normal;widows:2;\"><span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;\">· · ·</span></span></p>\n  <h2 style=\"font-variant-caps:normal;white-space:normal;font-weight:400;font-size:20px;box-sizing:border-box !important;text-decoration-thickness:initial;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;-webkit-tap-highlight-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);outline:0px;word-spacing:0px;text-indent:0px;border-left:4px solid rgb(231, 76, 60);font-family:-apple-system, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;orphans:2;text-decoration-color:initial;text-align:left;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;padding:0px 0px 0px 12px;margin:36px 0px 8px;visibility:visible;letter-spacing:normal;text-decoration-style:initial;font-style:normal;text-transform:none;max-width:100%;font-variant-ligatures:normal;widows:2;\"><span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;font-weight: bold;\">最后</span></span></h2>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\">工具这东西，最怕的不是不会用，而是</span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">以为自己会用了</span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\">。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\">Claude Code也是一样。很多人装完之后，随手丢一个需求进去，发现效果一般，就觉得“也就这样”。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\">所以这篇</span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">别只放进收藏夹吃灰</span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\">。上手试试，效果可能马上就不一样了。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\">今天就到这，如果觉得有帮助，欢迎</span><span style=\"font-weight:bold;font-size:15px;\">转发关注</span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\">~</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"display: none;\"></p>\n </body>\n</html>",
  "aiSummary": "博主分享 Claude Code 创始人 Boris Cherny 的实用技巧，包括初始化设置、让 AI 先理解项目、先规划再编码、接入工具、编写 CLAUDE.md 及实用快捷键。",
  "oneSentenceSummary": "博主分享 Claude Code 创始人 Boris Cherny 的实用技巧，包括初始化设置、让 AI 先理解项目、先规划再编码、接入工具、编写 CLAUDE.md 及实用快捷键。",
  "summary": "文章来源于傅盛的公众号，转载了 Claude Code 的创始人 Boris Cherny 在内部分享的使用技巧。文章首先介绍了安装后需要执行的四个基础命令：/terminal-setup 调整换行、/theme 选择主题、/install-github-app 安装 GitHub App 以便在 Issue 或 PR 中调用 Claude，以及自定义常用低风险工具集合。接着强调让 AI 先熟悉项目才能发挥作用，建议先让 Claude Code 浏览代码库并回答结构性问题，这样可以将新人熟悉代码库的时间从 2‑3 周缩短到 2‑3 天。随后提出“先规划再动手”的方法：在提出需求后先让 AI 给出实现方案、步骤和涉及模块，确认无误后再让其写代码，以降低返工风险。接着讲解如何让 Claude Code 接入团队工具（通过 Bash 调用 CLI 脚本或通过 MCP 接入结构化工具），使其能够自行验证结果、形成反馈闭环，示例展示了在有设计稿或测试脚本时 AI 的输出质量显著提升。文章还推荐编写 CLAUDE.md 作为 AI 的入职手册，建议保持简短、准确、硬核，可按项目子目录分放不同模块的规则。最后分享了一些实用快捷键：Shift+Tab 开启自动接受编辑、# 让 AI 记住规则并写入 CLAUDE.md、Esc 随时打断 AI、Ctrl+R 查看完整对话记录、claude --resume 恢复中断的对话。全文强调工具的价值在于主动引导和反馈，而非盲目下达指令。",
